{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/592689-buying-off-flaws","id":592689,"title":"Buying off flaws","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-07-16T08:53:43-07:00","id":592689,"title":"Buying off flaws","content":"Hello everyone,<br /> <br /> How do you handle buying off flaws with experience points? Do you allow it, and if so, how much do you &quot;charge&quot; for it in experience points? Do you allow it BEFORE roleplaying it in game? Is there anything published about it in any of the books?<br /> <br /> Thanks,<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5426-aecioborba","name":"aecioborba","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-16T09:29:11-07:00","id":592740,"title":"","content":"I believe there's at least one suggestion of Value x 3 XP out there. It's at least a fairly common house rule for people that want to buy off Flaws and use XP for it.<br /> <br /> I'm not sure what &quot;allow it BEFORE roleplaying it in game&quot; is supposed to mean. Is that, &quot;It's been ten sessions and this clearly doesn't matter, lets dump it?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-16T19:17:58-07:00","id":593464,"title":"","content":"It depends on the type of Flaw. Some can't be bought off at all However, if the Flaw is social in nature or otherwise contingent, then if the player successfully resolved/fixed it via Roleplay so that it is inappropriate for the ST to continue to make use out of it in game, then I'd rule the player could or even must pay it off in XP.<br /> <br /> I'd never allow the player to buy if off beforehand. It has to be earned during game. If the Flaw no longer applies, then I'd rule it would cost the amount of XP it would have required to buy whatever points he spent it on during character creation. This means it could be any number of points. I'd also rule it would have to be the most XP possible. It it was spent on Abilities for example, then figure out how much XP he would have spent to buy those Abilities with XP always taking in the most expensive way it could be as opposed to the least amount of XP.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox","name":"Black Fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-16T19:20:24-07:00","id":593466,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/592689-buying-off-flaws?p=592740#post592740\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is that, &quot;It's been ten sessions and this clearly doesn't matter, lets dump it?&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>I typically allow my players 3-5 game sessions of play to figure out if their character build makes sense. People sometimes assume things before game that isn't so, or just get the build wrong because they don't know the game system that well. If they want to &quot;rebuild&quot; the character, I let them provided I approve that new build.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox","name":"Black Fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-16T19:37:05-07:00","id":593471,"title":"","content":"There are no such a thing as an impossible to overcome flaw. This is an exercise of fiction, and in fiction you're free to think of valid means to do whatever you wants to.<br /> <br /> Instead of ruling something as impossible, just ask the player how he plans to get rid of it. Maybe he will surprise you with a very good idea that would perish unheard if you just barked &quot;impossible!&quot;<br /> <br /> 3-5 game sessions is a good rule-of-thumb to allow a reformulation, but tecnicaly it isn't buying out a flaw. I think 3 XP per point seems good, or just 2. I'm doing some experiments in altering the XP costs in the game and turning them into fixed costs, and intend to have, in the end, a simple 1 to 1 for Merits and Flaws.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}